WEBVTT

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.090
The rocks are...

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.550
floating...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.460
Why were the rocks floating?

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:06.740
What are you...?

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.620
No, um...

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:20.760
So what was going on, Sara?

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:22.810
Why were the rocks floating?

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:24.260
It is your fault.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:28.680
You outsiders have brought a Kadun of battle...

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.770
so the bonds between the rocks and the Earth have weakened.

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:39.110
At this rate, the link between the people will also weaken.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.280
The awakening of the birdman is close.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:44.530
Awakening of the birdman?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.790
I don't need to hear superstitions like that...

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.550
Why did a heavy rock like this...

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.340
Do not speak of what you saw to anyone.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:01:59.590
Otherwise...

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:02.090
I will attach a cursed Kadun to you.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:09.850
If I said that a rock like this floated, no one would believe me anyway.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.270
That's true...

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:20.320
You outsiders have a Kadun attached
to you that only believes what it sees.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.210
Someone's singing?

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.790
It is Rooy Kanu's voice.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:38.920
It is a voice that begs for forgiveness from the birdman, who has flown far away... across the ocean and back to the stars.

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.710
It is the voice of the holy mountain's cave.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.120
The generator?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.920
The PCS response disappeared.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.540
We were close.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.130
What's that?

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:17.920
What?

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.040
Could it be...

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.260
Yes! The professor has come to this island before!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.060
It's the same thing!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:42.440
The person I considered to be my teacher came up with the human proto-culture intervention hypothesis on this island.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.990
Proto-culture?

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.780
A hypothesis stating that there was alien
intervention in the evolution of mankind.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.620
If that hypothesis is proved...

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:59.050
We'll be able to find out how ancient civilization
came to be using these artifacts.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.050
I see.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.300
Who is it?!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:05.390
Shin?

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.090
This is a holy spring, none may trespass.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:10.810
You must not soil this place with a Kadun of fire.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.970
What? Oh... This is just...

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:17.730
So you came to reveal the secret of the birdman?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.690
Are you that old man's daughter?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.950
Old man?

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.320
Do you know Professor Hasford?

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.020
Hasford...

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:06.860
Get out!

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.870
For scientific research?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.790
For the villagers and for mankind?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.290
You broke the barriers that protects us and stole our blood...

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:15.450
Sis.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.290
Shin...

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.500
You people will bring about a big catastrophe!

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:26.050
Tell me one thing. The power that lies in your blood.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:32.340
The secret to the sacred song that is passed
along in the blood of the priestesses.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.100
Doctor!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.270
Sara!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.310
No...

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:43.600
Doctor Turner, I saw it!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.570
Saw...? Saw what?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.780
She made this rock float!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.040
W-What?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:53.790
Rock?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.830
Maybe she can even fly.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.000
Like that.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:11.390
You guys are just making fun of the proto-culture hypothesis!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.010
Give me that!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.300
Doctor!

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.600
You said...

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:25.940
...that we have a Kadun that only believes in
what we see. That just might be right.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.110
Shin...

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:30.360
What are you two doing together?

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:31.070
What?

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.030
Nothing.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.930
What is with this liquid's composition?

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.600
It's the same as human blood?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:58.060
And the blood type is Alpha Bombay, which means...

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.310
It's the same as the data the Doctor sent us from the island.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:08.520
I see. So the ASS-One's blood has almost the same genetic
make-up as the blood of the priestesses, correct?

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.700
We are currently working on an accurate comparison.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:12.610
Thank you.

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.660
This is getting interesting.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.330
Hey, Shin.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.410
What were you two doing so early in the morning?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.050
Or were you there all night...?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.930
You're a pilot, but you allowed me to attack you from behind.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.180
Mao! What was that all of a sudden...!

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.930
Geez, I thought I was going to die.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:49.820
Hey.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.990
I don't see that many people around. Did they go somewhere?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.490
Is it that holy pilgrimage thing?

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.240
Oh, everyone's there.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.630
...into a new era...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:21.970
Looks like everyone is having fun.

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:30.940
But what will Sara say if she saw this...

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:32.950
Let's go.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.070
Hey, Mao!

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.160
I'll show you my treasure!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.280
Treasure?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.540
What about me, Mao-chan?

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.620
Nothing for you.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.660
Let's go, Shin.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.370
Hey, Shin!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.460
Her sister as well?

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.930
You need one of these spears, they're the basics of love.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.250
Mao...

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.430
Out of breath already?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.310
Lieutenant Kudou?

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:40.950
I never lost... in the diving exercises
we had... in case of a water landing.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.290
Damn...

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.820
Mao, you're more like a fishman than human.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.210
And you're the birdman, right, Shin?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.580
Yep.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.590
But, Shin, you don't want to see my treasure?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.850
You have to dive much deeper than that.

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.880
I like the sky better than the ocean.

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:16.520
Amazing.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:22.230
Flying fish are said to be the first children
of Rooy Kanu and Rooy Waka.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.570
That's why they like to fly, but are also good at swimming.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:43.500
Birds can swim in the ocean, and fish can also fly.

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.050
God of the sacred spring...

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:53.390
The bond between the Earth and the rocks has weakened.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:12:00.150
Did these disasters occur because I broke the rule?

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:17.330
More! More!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:28.680
Hey, do you like my sister?

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.230
Geez...

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:48.990
Mao.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.080
What is she...?

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.250
What happened?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.460
Shin...

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.660
Mao.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.420
No...

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.720
I know you are there, even if you are hiding!

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.350
So it's you again?

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.610
Your power, wasn't it?

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.870
No, it was a Kadun.

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.290
No, it was you.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.450
A Kadun!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:18.500
This island didn't have any problems until you white people came.

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:20.490
But now...

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:28.380
people have begun to dispute over small things...

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.720
Wasn't that amazing?

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:45.280
Amazing... it was, but what was that thing?

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:47.270
Why did it glow?

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.400
What? I don't know.

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:53.360
It had a dim glow when I found it, but...

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.460
It was the first time it glowed that brightly.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.280
What?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.500
I know.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.500
Maybe it was because you and I kissed.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:04.960
What...?

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.130
Could this be the thing that the military is looking for...?

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:11.380
What?

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.010
Schwalbe-One to all wings.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:57.550
For this operation, we are going to capture the birdman's
body from inside the enemy's main aircraft carrier.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.020
Heavy fighting is predicted at the front.

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.810
Do not waste your bullets.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:04.730
Let's go.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:10.900
Hurry!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.240
The Asuka is under attack!

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:14.980
I'm going as fast as I can!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.070
Zero?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.160
Almost...

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:35.090
What are you doing?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.590
The Zero was built for battling in space, as well!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.350
It'll still work even if I close the intake for two or three minutes.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.260
Geez...

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.060
Mao, you go back to where everyone is.

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.060
Okay.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.860
Mao, what's wrong?

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.740
Shin, protect the treasure!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.700
Please free it to the skies!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:01.710
Free it?

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.210
A Kadun is coming to get the treasure!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:07.250
Not good!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:15.970
Put her inside!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.880
I know!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:21.600
Could it be...

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.060
The treasure... Protect it.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.720
You say to protect it, but...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:32.640
Edgar! Take care of Mao!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:34.440
Let's go!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.280
What are you going to do?!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:38.940
This thing can last two to three minutes underwater, right?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.680
We're going to sink the small fries and head for the target.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.000
Follow me!

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.380
Let's go!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:06.690
Take this!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.910
The Algeciras has been destroyed.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.200
Currently evacuation to the coast.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.360
Drop them!

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.830
Damn it, from behind?

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.840
DD, I'll get rid of these guys and come back to you.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.540
Leave some for me.

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.050
You better hurry, then.

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.340
Calm down!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.570
Hey, cowboy, over here!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.600
Don't waste my time.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.510
I'll protect this spot.

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.560
DD, you get the birdman.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:28.230
Okay.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:35.810
That's...

00:19:37.490 --> 00:19:38.360
Damn it!

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.290
It's a Battroid!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:52.620
Don't let the enemy in!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.170
This must be it.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.970
Get out of the way!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.140
What?

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:17.850
Out!

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.650
Not good enough!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:25.120
Take this...!

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:27.490
I have no choice!

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.960
Schwalbe-Two, formation D-Quick!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:33.540
Roger!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.040
What?!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.180
Got him.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.730
A reactive armor?

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.400
I'm not done yet!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:00.820
What?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.040
Take that!

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.600
Chrom Zwei to all wings.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.970
I have discovered something believed to be a part of the birdman.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:42.640
It was stolen by an enemy transformable fighter, and
is currently running towards the Mayan island.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:43.860
DD!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.940
I'm short on fuel.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:49.990
I'll distract this guy while you get the birdman's part, Nora.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.490
Roger. I'll definitely get it back.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.870
All right, Focker!

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.210
You'll have to deal with me!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.220
Be careful.

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:11.920
Got her.

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:13.560
Shin?

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:14.380
Sara!

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:16.510
Mao!

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.220
Damage, light.

00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:21.890
But I only have 11 shots left.

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:25.400
Not enough to make me feel safe.

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:29.570
PCS reactor detected.

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:30.950
You're not getting away!

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:37.280
Mao! Mao!

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:38.580
Get a grip!

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:41.370
She has mentally recessed from the shock!

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:42.750
We have to treat her immediately!

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:44.010
Don't touch her!

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:44.790
But...!

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:49.130
No, Mao has a Kadun of battle in her.

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:51.420
We must borrow the power of Pukinuha.

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:53.560
Pukinuha?

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:55.350
Why did you get Mao hurt as well?

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.590
Why did you get her involved in the battle?

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:02.390
Because...

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:05.320
It's the enemy!

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:05.990
Enemy?

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:16.910
Hurry!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:17.570
Yes, sir!

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.580
Watch out!

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:30.550
Let's go.

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:32.710
They're after Mao's treasure.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:35.470
Is that...?

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:37.850
Is that the legendary...

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:39.350
...fragment of AFOS?

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.680
No! You mustn't awaken the birdman!

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:48.860
Shin!

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:50.650
Alpha Base, respond.

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:22.140
What Father told me was true.

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:29.270
If we hold connections with the outsiders,
the Kadun of misfortune will come upon us.

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:33.700
The birdman will sing the song of destruction...

00:24:36.830 --> 00:24:39.540
Nutuk, please take care of Mao.

00:24:39.540 --> 00:24:42.200
What... Sara, are you...?

00:24:42.200 --> 00:24:44.920
I must do my job as a priestess... to stop the song of destruction!

00:24:44.920 --> 00:24:45.750
What?

00:24:45.750 --> 00:24:46.290
Sara!

00:24:46.290 --> 00:24:47.620
Where are you going to go?

00:24:49.470 --> 00:24:51.250
Shin, this place is dangerous.

00:24:51.250 --> 00:24:53.840
We have to evacuate somewhere until we
can confirm the safety of the Asuka.

00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:54.800
I know.

00:24:56.300 --> 00:24:57.680
That's the guy who dropped us last time!

00:24:57.680 --> 00:24:58.420
What?!

00:25:02.980 --> 00:25:04.230
A woman?

00:25:04.230 --> 00:25:05.150
She's the one who...?

00:25:06.440 --> 00:25:07.650
The little boy again?

00:25:07.940 --> 00:25:09.400
I'm not losing this time!

00:25:11.110 --> 00:25:12.360
You're not getting away!

00:25:22.370 --> 00:25:22.870
Damn it!

00:25:23.160 --> 00:25:23.830
It's jammed!

00:25:23.830 --> 00:25:25.500
The ocean water must've gotten to it!

00:25:25.500 --> 00:25:27.160
Take this!

00:25:37.590 --> 00:25:38.550
Behind!

00:25:39.140 --> 00:25:40.670
Our plane is too heavy!

00:25:44.480 --> 00:25:45.640
Beneath us!

00:25:45.640 --> 00:25:46.400
Dealing with her!

00:25:55.650 --> 00:25:56.450
What?

00:26:01.750 --> 00:26:02.540
Got it.

00:26:12.720 --> 00:26:13.580
What?

00:26:24.140 --> 00:26:26.190
Schwalbe-Two to Chrom Leader.

00:26:26.190 --> 00:26:27.230
They got my fighter.

00:26:27.230 --> 00:26:28.260
Requesting backup.

00:26:32.900 --> 00:26:34.060
Evacuate immediately!

00:26:34.900 --> 00:26:36.320
Give her to the research team.

00:26:36.610 --> 00:26:38.150
She's a rare sample.

00:26:38.150 --> 00:26:39.410
Sample?

00:26:39.410 --> 00:26:40.370
Doctor!

00:26:40.370 --> 00:26:41.650
I'm going after the AFOS.

00:26:43.500 --> 00:26:44.290
Doctor!

00:26:48.710 --> 00:26:49.660
Good luck.

00:27:13.570 --> 00:27:15.480
Here's the blood that matches her.

00:27:15.990 --> 00:27:17.070
Okay.

00:27:17.070 --> 00:27:18.060
Get ready for the operation.

00:27:20.530 --> 00:27:21.870
Are you serious?

00:27:21.870 --> 00:27:24.120
We're going to use this monster's blood and...

00:27:24.540 --> 00:27:25.570
It can't be helped.

00:27:25.950 --> 00:27:29.870
This guy's body fluids are the same quality as human blood.

00:27:29.870 --> 00:27:32.910
And its blood type is Alpha Bombay.

00:27:33.670 --> 00:27:38.380
Only this thing matches that blood type of
the priestess within a 2,000 km radius.

00:27:38.970 --> 00:27:42.420
I didn't expect the proto-culture hypothesis to be true...

00:27:56.150 --> 00:27:57.060
Sara!

00:28:08.290 --> 00:28:09.580
What are you doing?!

00:28:09.580 --> 00:28:11.750
Where is the birdman's head?

00:28:11.750 --> 00:28:13.340
Birdman's head?

00:28:13.340 --> 00:28:15.460
The one you stole with the steel bird!

00:28:16.880 --> 00:28:19.290
That's Mao's treasure.

00:28:19.720 --> 00:28:21.630
Mao asked me to protect it from the Kadun.

00:28:21.630 --> 00:28:25.970
Mao? You and Mao called on the birdman?

00:28:25.970 --> 00:28:27.350
No!

00:28:27.350 --> 00:28:30.640
I didn't know that Mao's treasure was such a thing...

00:28:31.190 --> 00:28:36.100
If the birdman awakens, the world could get destroyed...

00:28:47.870 --> 00:28:50.200
I found you, little boy.

00:28:51.830 --> 00:28:52.910
You're...!

00:29:03.720 --> 00:29:09.390
Chapter Three

00:29:03.720 --> 00:29:09.390
Blue and Desperate Battle

00:29:23.570 --> 00:29:36.290
fureau kokoro de ai ni toroketa

00:29:23.570 --> 00:29:36.290
With our hearts touching each other, we melted in love

00:29:38.090 --> 00:29:50.140
asahi no youni atae teraseba

00:29:38.090 --> 00:29:50.140
If we give and shine like the morning lights...

00:29:52.600 --> 00:29:57.810
ai no kiseki nanokashira

00:29:52.600 --> 00:29:57.810
Will it be like a miracle of love?

00:29:59.650 --> 00:30:04.570
ai no kiseki wa hana no you

00:29:59.650 --> 00:30:04.570
The miracle of love is like a flower

00:30:10.410 --> 00:30:20.960
koe wo kikasete uta wo kikasete

00:30:10.410 --> 00:30:20.960
Let me hear your voice, let me hear you sing

00:30:24.590 --> 00:30:29.180
hana ni negai wo kakereba

00:30:24.590 --> 00:30:29.180
If we wish upon a flower...

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:36.390
ai wo hakonde kurerunoyo

00:30:31.600 --> 00:30:36.390
it will carry love for you
